<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Giovanni Carone</title>
<meta name="description" content="Giovanni Carone – Curriculum in italiano e in inglese, profilo LinkedIn.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,600&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #eef4f1;
    --card: #fbfdfc;
    --ink: #1f3a4d;
    --muted: #5d7384;
    --accent: #3f8f86;
    --accent-soft: #dcece8;
    --line: #d3e0db;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
  html, body { height: 100%; }
  body {
    font-family: "Figtree", system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    padding: 24px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  main {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 44px 32px 32px;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -24px rgba(31, 58, 77, .25);
  }
  .monogram {
    width: 92px; height: 92px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 34px;
    letter-spacing: .02em;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: "Fraunces", Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .sub { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 8px; font-size: 1rem; }
  .actions { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .btn {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--accent);
    font: inherit; font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: transparent;
    transition: background .15s, color .15s, transform .15s;
  }
  .btn.primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--ink); }
  .btn.primary:hover { background: #347a72; color: #fff; }
  .btn:active { transform: scale(.98); }
  .btn:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .btn svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; flex: none; }
  .linkedin { margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .linkedin .btn { border-color: var(--line); color: var(--muted); }
  .linkedin .btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--ink); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .btn { transition: none; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">GC</div>
    <h1>Giovanni Carone</h1>
    <p class="sub">Scarica il mio curriculum o contattami su LinkedIn.</p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/16vdOSyrUCb7TYRQBeqY1Htnp9WfgwFEB/view?usp=drivesdk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><path d="M9 13h6M9 17h6"/></svg>
        CV in italiano
      </a>
      <a class="btn" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IkQfPBy9ezugXFA2-_DgeOIlpiP5QvQy/view?usp=drivesdk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" lang="en">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5"/><path d="M9 13h6M9 17h6"/></svg>
        CV in English
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="linkedin">
      <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/giovanni-carone" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.03-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.86 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg>
        Profilo LinkedIn
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
